---
source: crates/vitrify-cli/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: "long_help(&cmd, &path)"
---
Print the embedded normative schema documents

Usage: vitrify schema <COMMAND>

Commands:
  show  Print the embedded normative schema (SDD by default)
  help  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')

Subcommands: show (print the normative SDD schema, or the TDD schema with --tdd)
Exit status: 2 without a subcommand; see each subcommand's --help
Examples:
  vitrify schema show
  vitrify schema show --tdd
